//! OpenAPI spec for Trade8:Bars.
//!
//! Generated by `utoipa` from `#[utoipa::path]` annotations. The routed
//! handlers live in `main.rs` (binary crate); the spec describes them through
//! spec-only wrappers in `crate::bars` (same method + path), the RFW admin
//! fns through `crate::admin_ui::*`, and the shared Shield policy-admin
//! surface through the `sentin8::shell::policy_*` wrappers
//! (`sentin8/design/sentin8-openapi-coverage-design.md` §2). The service
//! exposes `GET /openapi.json` via the shell's OpenAPI route.

