/// the `#[utoipa::path]` attribute is written, and `paths()` resolves them as
/// `module::__path_fn`. The wrappers live in `crate::openapi::bars` so the derive can reference the markers while
/// the real `main.rs` handlers keep serving the routes (same method + path on
/// both sides).
